Subtask 4.3: Create GCP Dynamic Inventory
Create a dynamic inventory configuration for GCP:

cat > inventories/gcp_compute.yml << 'EOF'
---
plugin: google.cloud.gcp_compute
projects:
  - YOUR_PROJECT_ID
auth_kind: serviceaccount
service_account_file: ~/multi-cloud-lab/credentials/gcp-key.json
